        "original_id": "fbc70f59-c3ca-59f0-aec8-29ac77af774a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gábor Csupó, Dakota Blue Richards, Augustus Prew\n- Films and TV: The Secret of Moonacre, About a Boy, Charlie St. Cloud, The Borgias, Kick-Ass 2, Klondike, Rugrats, Duckman, Aaahh!!!\n- Companies: Klasky Csupo\n\nFacts:\n- Gábor Csupó co-founded the animation studio Klasky Csupo, which produced shows including \"Rugrats,\" \"Duckman,\" and \"Aaahh!!!\".\n- Augustus Prew appeared in the film \"About a Boy\" in 2002.\n- Gábor Csupó directed the film \"The Secret of Moonacre,\" and Dakota Blue Richards starred in the leading role.\n- Augustus Prew appeared in the film \"The Secret of Moonacre\" in 2008.\n- Augustus Prew appeared in the film \"Charlie St. Cloud\" in 2010.\n- Augustus Prew appeared in \"The Borgias\" in 2011.\n- Augustus Prew appeared in \"Kick-Ass 2\" in 2013.\n- Augustus Prew appeared in the miniseries \"Klondike\" in 2014.",
